    -- coroutine.resume returned while the script was still waiting on its first readfile / isfile / writefile / request,
    -- the dump was saved at that point and everything after it was lost. Script-level yields are flagged in K.sy
    -- (coroutine.yield, the cooperative task.wait of spawned threads); every other suspension is a host future, and
